{
  "key": 54323,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_MayISeeNatures",
      "en_US": [
        "That glaringly bright and cool thing\n",
        "you have!\r",
        "It’s undoubtedly a Pokétch!\n",
        "The latest model, no less!\r",
        "They’re awesome, yeah?\r",
        "I got OK’d by the Pokétch Company\n",
        "to develop original Pokétch apps.\r",
        "Hey, you’re a Trainer, right?\n",
        "Can you do me a favor?\r",
        "You’ve got Pokémon with different\n",
        "natures, right? May I see them?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_LikeToSeeSeriousNature",
      "en_US": [
        "What am I in the mood to see now...\r",
        "I’d like to see a Pokémon with\n",
        "a Serious nature."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_LikeToSeeNaiveNature",
      "en_US": [
        "What am I in the mood to see now...\r",
        "I’d like to see a Pokémon with\n",
        "a Naive nature."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_LikeToSeeQuirkyNature",
      "en_US": [
        "What am I in the mood to see now...\r",
        "I’d like to see a Pokémon with\n",
        "a Quirky nature."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_IllGiveCalendarApp",
      "en_US": [
        "Yep! Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} has\n",
        "a Serious nature all right!\r",
        "Thanks! I’ll give you this\n",
        "Calendar app for your Pokétch.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_IllGiveDotArtistApp",
      "en_US": [
        "Yep! Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} has\n",
        "a Naive nature all right!\r",
        "Thanks! I’ll give you this\n",
        "Dot Artist app for your Pokétch.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_IllGiveRouletteApp",
      "en_US": [
        "Yep! Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} has\n",
        "a Quirky nature all right!\r",
        "Thanks! I’ll give you this\n",
        "Roulette app for your Pokétch.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_AppsMayOutnumberPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Someday, Pokétch apps may outnumber\n",
        "all the species of Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_SovereignTheStrongestMove",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, hello!\n",
        "I’m shocked you came to visit!\r",
        "That rocky surface outside puts a\n",
        "lot of potential travelers off.\r",
        "And look at you!\n",
        "You’re an amazing Trainer!\r",
        "Yes, I want to give you something!\n",
        "An ultimate technique!\r",
        "Behold the Technical Machine that has\n",
        "the strongest move, Hyper Beam!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_SovereignHyperBeamRecharge",
      "en_US": [
        "Hyper Beam is a super powerful move,\n",
        "but the user cannot take any action\f",
        "on the turn after they use it.\r",
        "It’s not the strongest possible move\n",
        "either, if you want to be precise...\r",
        "But it’ll consistently serve you with\n",
        "some truly awesome power!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_SovereignPutItToGoodUse",
      "en_US": [
        "I hope you’re putting that technique\n",
        "to good use, Trainer!\r",
        "There’s some Pokémon that can get a\n",
        "lot of mileage out of it."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
